* [[Honda Shigetada]] (1542–1610) — first shogun of the Honda Shogunate, who secured the Asuka Pass during the Sengoku period
* [[Kiso Masahiko]] (1924–2001) — polymer chemist (born in Tochigi, moved to Noto for contact lens research)
* [[Teraoka Yumi]] (born 1978) — optical physicist, developer of the Tochigi Precision coating process

